      <p style="font-size:0.8125rem;color:var(--color-muted);margin-bottom:1rem;"><a href="/" style="color:var(--color-accent);">Home</a> &rsaquo; Song Dynasty Hanfu Style</p>
      <h1>Song Dynasty Hanfu Style: The Art of Quiet Elegance</h1>
      <p class="lead" style="font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--color-muted);margin-top:1.5rem;line-height:1.55;">
        Song Dynasty Hanfu is the introvert's luxury: beauty found in simplicity, quality revealed in subtlety. Where Tang shouts in jewel tones, Song whispers in celadon green, moon white, and lavender grey. The iconic beizi jacket creates the most modern and wearable silhouette in all of Hanfu.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0;">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="media-card" style="margin-bottom:2.5rem; grid-template-columns: 38% 62%;">
